Notice — Not a Medical Device

This software is designed for healthcare professionals as a clinical decision
support resource. It does not provide medical diagnoses, treatment
recommendations for individual patients, or replace clinical judgment. It is
not intended for direct patient care, not FDA-cleared, and not HIPAA-certified.
It is not a medical device. The HEARTLAND Risk Stratification Framework is a
proposed tool under development; it has not been validated against clinical
outcomes data.
